{context}

Return the score and band.

Write a concise evidence-bounded customer-voice note for this one market-research ticket. Distinguish the customer's description from recorded metadata and explicitly avoid claims about prevalence or causes.

{context}

Return a labeled note without adding unsupported claims.

Convert the supplied individual support ticket into a JSON object with product, issue_category, priority, channel, and satisfaction_rating keys. Use null for missing values. Do not add inferred fields.

{context}

Return valid JSON only.

